items.BF_Armor_Module_Shield.name = Shield Module
items.BF_Armor_Module_Shield.description = An energy shield of 25 points that takes damage before your health does. Recharges 3 s after the last hit, 5 points per second (50 kW). Drowning and falling out of the world go through. Right-click a block to put it into your Modular Armor.
items.BF_Armor_Module_Exoskeleton.name = Exoskeleton Module
items.BF_Armor_Module_Exoskeleton.description = You run 30 % faster while it has energy (100 kW). Right-click a block to put it into your Modular Armor.
items.BF_Armor_Module_Night_Vision.name = Night Vision Module
items.BF_Armor_Module_Night_Vision.description = Lights up your surroundings with a green residual-light view and brightens the night sky around you while it has energy (10 kW). Right-click a block to put it into your Modular Armor.
items.BF_Armor_Module_Battery.name = Battery Module
items.BF_Armor_Module_Battery.description = Stores 20 MJ for the other modules. Right-click a block to put it into your Modular Armor.
items.BF_Armor_Module_Solar.name = Solar Module
items.BF_Armor_Module_Solar.description = Charges the armour by day (30 kW in full sun). Right-click a block to put it into your Modular Armor.
items.BF_Armor_Module_Goblin_Backpack.name = Goblin Backpack
items.BF_Armor_Module_Goblin_Backpack.description = A goblin in your backpack builds ghosts within 8 blocks from the parts you carry (20 kW). Right-click a block to put it into your Modular Armor.
items.BF_Modular_Armor.name = Modular Armor
items.BF_Modular_Armor.description = Chest armour with a grid for 6 modules. Right-click it in your hand to open the grid; left-click puts it on. /armor shows the modules of the armour you wear.
